# Every line names its cause: what writes the path under the root.

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The Go binary; `make build` writes it, `daisy install` links ~/bin/daisy to it
bin/

# Secrets: `daisy check-secrets` reads the workspace's .env.sh, and the root
# can itself be a workspace (below)
.env.sh

# What `daisy init <identity>` writes when run in the root, binding it as a
# workspace: init's own block (init and clean edit it, so it keeps init's
# header and entries), then the skills of the home the root is bound to
# (gitea's here), each in .claude/skills and Codex's .agents/skills.

# Daisy workspace config (per-machine)
.daisy/
.daisy.stage.*
.daisy.previous.*
.cursor/rules/daisy.mdc
.cursor/rules/daisy-logging.mdc
.cursor/rules/daisy-plan.mdc
.claude/commands/daisy.md
.claude/settings.local.json
PLAN.md
.cursorignore
.claude/skills/gitea/
.cursor/rules/gitea.mdc
.agents/skills/daisy/SKILL.md
.agents/skills/gitea/
